\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Bear Case\",[[0,9,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$580B – $800B\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Grounded in secondary market tender levels (~$800B); assumes margin compression on Starlink and multiple compression toward industrial/defense comps (12x–15x sales).\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Base / Consensus Case\",[[0,21,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$1.0T – $1.3T\",[[0,13,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Strong recurring Starlink cash flow (~$15B–$20B run-rate) paired with continued commercial launch dominance; valued at 20x–25x forward revenue.\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Bull Case\",[[0,9,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$1.5T – $2.0T+\",[[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"High-end Wall Street projections pricing SpaceX as an orbital infrastructure and telecommunications monopoly, assuming rapid Starship commercialization and direct-to-cell scaling.\"]]]]]]],true]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Upside Catalysts\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink Unit Economics \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion: Starlink's recurring subscriber revenue forms the bedrock of modern SpaceX valuation models. Rapid enterprise adoption (aviation, maritime) and monetization of direct-to-cell telecom partnerships provide high-margin, scalable software/telecom multiples rather than lower aerospace hardware multiples.\",[[0,51,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Reusability \\u0026 Payload Capacity: Full operational deployment of Starship dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit\",[[0,40,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https