hips provide high-margin, scalable software/telecom multiples rather than lower aerospace hardware multiples.\",[[0,51,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Reusability \\u0026 Payload Capacity: Full operational deployment of Starship dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit. This unlocks massive margin expansion for deploying next-gen Starlink satellites and captures higher-margin deep-space and NASA Artemis mission revenue.\",[[0,40,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Defense \\u0026 National Security Moat: Starshield expansion and high-priority government intelligence contracts guarantee stable, long-dated federal cash flows with minimal competition.\",[[0,33,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Public Market Liquidity Premium: Continued preparations or structural carve-outs ahead of potential public listings create heightened\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
