[["wrb.fr",null,"[null,[\"c_1ee83e8501ea6bc0\",\"r_ac2fa738c07495a6\"],null,null,[[\"rc_39569488f1a7d2ee\",[\"Expert predictions for SpaceX’s valuation heading into the end of 2026 center around an **$800 billion to $1.5 trillion** range, with consensus clustering around the **$1.0T to $1.3T** mark depending on market liquidity and whether valuation is measured via private secondary transactions or implied public-market targets. \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Valuation Snapshot \\u0026 Expert Ranges\\n\\n| Scenario | Implied Valuation | Key Drivers / Valuation Basis |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **Bear Case** | **$580B – $800B** | Grounded in secondary market tender levels (~$800B); assumes margin compression on Starlink and multiple compression toward industrial/defense comps (12x–15x sales). |\\n| **Base / Consensus Case** | **$1.0T – $1.3T** | Strong recurring Starlink cash flow (~$15B–$20B run-rate) paired with continued commercial launch dominance; valued at 20x–25x forward revenue. |\\n| **Bull Case** | **$1.5T – $2.0T+** | High-end Wall Street projections pricing SpaceX as an orbital infrastructure and telecommunications monopoly, assuming rapid Starship commercialization and direct-to-cell scaling. |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Key Upside Catalysts\\n\\n* **Starlink Unit Economics \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion:** Starlink's recurring subscriber revenue forms the bedrock of modern SpaceX valuation models. Rapid enterprise adoption (aviation, maritime) and monetization of direct-to-cell telecom partnerships provide high-margin, scalable software/telecom multiples rather than lower aerospace hardware multiples.\\n* **Starship Reusability \\u0026 Payload Capacity:** Full operational deployment of Starship dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit. This unlocks massive margin expansion for deploying next-gen Starlink satellites and captures higher-margin deep-space and NASA Artemis mission revenue.\\n* **Defense \\u0026 National Security Moat:** Starshield expansion and high-priority government intelligence contracts guarantee stable, long-dated federal cash flows with minimal competition.\\n* **Public Market Liquidity Premium:** Continued preparations or structural carve-outs ahead of potential public listings create heightened institutional demand and liquidity premiums relative to traditional private market discounts\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],\"en\",null,null,[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[[[],\"Searched the web\",\"Google Search\",\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg/v6/192px.svg\",[],\"Searched the web\",\"\",[[\"https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.thinkmarkets.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.thinkmarkets.com/en/trading-academy/market-events/spacex-ipo-2026-date-spacex-valuation-and-proxy-share-cfds/\",\"SpaceX Valuation 2026: Latest Figures, IPO Date \\u0026 How to Trade\",null,[]],[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://satnews.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://satnews.com/2025/12/06/spacex-targets-800-billion-valuation-in-secondary-sale-eyes-2026-ipo/\",\"SpaceX Targets $800 Billion Valuation in Secondary Sale, Eyes\",null,[]],[\"https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://www.3040wealth.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fallback_opts\\u003dTYPE,SIZE,URL\",\"https://www.3040wealth.com/equity-advantage/how-to-pay-no-tax-on-the-spacex-tender-and-prep-for-a-usd1-5-trillion-2026\",\"SpaceX Tender \\u0026 IPO: Tax Strategies - 30/40 Wealth\",null,[]],[\"https://t2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url\\u003dhttps://sacra.com/\\u0026client\\u003dBARD\\u0026type\\u003dFAVICON\\u0026size\\u003d256\\u0026fa