ll,3,\"Key Upside Catalysts\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink Unit Economics \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Expansion: Starlink's recurring subscriber revenue forms the bedrock of modern SpaceX valuation models. Rapid enterprise adoption (aviation, maritime) and monetization of direct-to-cell telecom partnerships provide high-margin, scalable software/telecom multiples rather than lower aerospace hardware multiples.\",[[0,51,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Reusability \\u0026 Payload Capacity: Full operational deployment of Starship dramatically reduces cost-per-kilogram to orbit. This unlocks massive margin expansion for deploying next-gen Starlink satellites and captures higher-margin deep-space and NASA Artemis mission revenue.\",[[0,40,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Defense \\u0026 National Security Moat: Starshield expansion and high-priority government intelligence contracts guarantee stable, long-dated federal cash flows with minimal competition.\",[[0,33,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Public Market Liquidity Premium: Continued preparations or structural carve-outs ahead of potential public listings create heightened institutional demand and liquidity premiums relative to traditional private market discounts.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Regulatory and Technical Bottlenecks: Delays in full orbital reusability, Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) environmental review hurdles, or high capital expenditure burn rates from testing could weigh\",[[0,46,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\